SUMMARY:URBAN CONFLICT RP
DESCRIPTION:URBAN CONFLICT When he died‚ so too did the world‚ it all s
 tarted with a big bang boom. Major capital's around the world were engulfed
  in flames. With American soil the first to burn. That was around two years
  ago‚ the world's super powers were overthrown by so called terrorists‚
  it was a full blown civil war. Over time other populations began Rebellion
 s against their home countries aswell. Governments collapsed‚ capital's b
 urned‚ and the economy was in ruin‚ overtime citizens finally got what 
 they fought for. The ultimate freedom‚ however with no rules nor laws‚ 
 it quickly turned to chaos. Now in the span of two years the world began to
  eat itself as it was in a state of constant conflict. Most notable about t
 he conflict where they were fought Most‚ in urban areas. Giving it the ni
 ckname. Urban Conflict. Out here‚ there isn't good or bad. Only wants and
  needs. The number one rule in the Urban Conflict is to never trust anyone.
  Not even your loved ones. The world you once knew isn't coming back.
